  "goodToKnow": "Der Denkmalschutz is the protection of historic buildings and monuments, a matter for the Länder. Unter Denkmalschutz stehen means to be a listed building, which limits renovations but brings tax benefits. Germany has around one million listed monuments. On the Tag des offenen Denkmals (second Sunday in September), many are opened to the public. Das Denkmal is a monument. It has no plural."
